{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 44","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/e/91e4864e3379bc8abf581edf8370ffdd49526798.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\log x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174f1451863100a3a1fb438d9084ec2c976d6bb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{Cuts the }y\\text{-axis} \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{Cuts all lines perpendicular to the }x\\text{-axis} \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{Cuts the }x\\text{-axis} \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{Cuts neither axis} \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{Cuts all circles whose center is at the origin}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"351\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bce8215d06329a6105e2e221d0512cb9bcfc4e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\log x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> includes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/754e946d1a160f767f0f61cbd9460401c2d1c17f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, so it <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/1/51165391d082f4839731d2127857365320d830cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{Cuts the }x\\text{-axis}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"158\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>Choice (A) is incorrect since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/9160d4e16f3e94095c76de397650460361957edd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> is undefined.\n</p><p>Choice (B) is incorrect since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/9160d4e16f3e94095c76de397650460361957edd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> is undefined and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is perpendicular to the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis.\n</p><p>Choice (D) is incorrect since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bce8215d06329a6105e2e221d0512cb9bcfc4e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\log x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> intersects the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis.\n</p><p>Choice (E) is incorrect since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bce8215d06329a6105e2e221d0512cb9bcfc4e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\log x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> does not intersect a circle of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8e15844d523efe58af54649ee285b2c23a96b20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> centered at the origin.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">Problem 43</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">Problem 45</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_